The Atelier platform is designed to fit into existing practices without introducing a rupture in working methods. It provides an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the firm's professionals' work environment, supporting them in their daily activities. The solution does not produce binding or signed deliverables; instead, it assists professionals in drafting documents and ensures that all figures and factual statements are grounded in and traceable to a source document.

To ensure data sovereignty, our platform is hosted on OuraneCloud, which holds the SecNumCloud certification, guaranteeing that our hosting infrastructure meets the required standards for securing confidential data within the EU. We also employ encryption in transit via TLS 1.3 and at rest through AES-256, as well as pseudonymisation where relevant.

Our consortium has experience working with clients bound by professional secrecy, including regulated professions and public-sector clients. We ensure that our contractual framework does not place us or our tooling in a position that could compromise our professional obligations, including auditor independence and separation of duties for statutory audit missions.

